#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.rst:2
msgid "nanrms"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:1
msgid "Compute the root mean square of a tensor, ignoring NaN values."
msgstr "NaN 値を無視して、テンソルの二乗平均平方根（RMS）を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:3
msgid ""
"This function calculates the root mean square (RMS) of tensor elements "
"along the specified dimension(s), excluding NaN values from the "
"computation. NaN values are treated as missing data and contribute to "
"neither the sum of squares nor the count, so this function relates to "
":func:`rms` exactly as :func:`nanmean` relates to the ordinary mean. The "
"RMS measures the magnitude of values regardless of their signs, and is "
"commonly used to quantify the size of signals or returns."
msgstr "この関数は、指定された次元に沿ってテンソル要素の二乗平均平方根（RMS）を計算します。計算時には NaN 値は除外されます。NaN 値は欠損データとして扱われ、二乗和にもカウントにも寄与しません。したがって、この関数と :func:`rms` の関係は、:func:`nanmean` と通常の平均の関係とまったく同じです。RMS は符号によらず値の大きさを測るもので、シグナルやリターンの大きさを定量化するためによく用いられます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:12
msgid "The NaN-aware root mean square is computed as:"
msgstr "NaN を考慮した二乗平均平方根は以下のように計算されます："

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:14
msgid ""
"\\text{nanrms}(X) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{N_{\\text{valid}}}\n"
"    \\sum_{i \\text{ valid}} X_i^2}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{nanrms}(X) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{N_{\\text{valid}}}\n"
"    \\sum_{i \\text{ valid}} X_i^2}\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:18
msgid ""
"where the sum is over valid (non-NaN) values and "
":math:`N_{\\text{valid}}` is the number of valid values."
msgstr "ここで、和は有効な値（NaN でない値）に対して計算され、:math:`N_{\\text{valid}}` は有効な値の個数を表します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:22
msgid "The input tensor containing values."
msgstr "値を含む入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:25
msgid ""
"The dimension(s) along which to compute the root mean square. If ``None``"
" (default), reduces over all dimensions."
msgstr "二乗平均平方根を計算する次元を指定します。``None``\\ （デフォルト）の場合、すべての次元にわたって縮約します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:29
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor has :attr:`dim` retained or not. Default is "
"``False``."
msgstr "出力テンソルが :attr:`dim` を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは ``False`` です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:33
msgid ""
"The root mean square computed only over valid (non-NaN) values. When no "
"valid values exist along a dimension, the result is NaN. The shape "
"depends on the input dimensions, :attr:`dim`, and :attr:`keepdim` "
"parameters."
msgstr "この二乗平均平方根は、有効な値（NaN でない値）のみに対して計算されます。指定した次元に沿って有効な値が存在しない場合、結果は NaN となります。出力の形状は、入力の次元、:attr:`dim` パラメータ、および :attr:`keepdim` パラメータに依存します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:40
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:42
msgid ""
">>> # Simple root mean square with NaN values\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([3.0, nan, -4.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x)\n"
"tensor(3.5355)"
msgstr ""
">>> # NaN 値を含む単純な二乗平均平方根\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([3.0, nan, -4.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x)\n"
"tensor(3.5355)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:47
msgid ""
">>> # Matches rms() when no NaN values are present\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, -2.0, 3.0, -4.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x)\n"
"tensor(2.7386)"
msgstr ""
">>> # NaN 値が存在しない場合は rms() と一致\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, -2.0, 3.0, -4.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x)\n"
"tensor(2.7386)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:52
msgid ""
">>> # 2D tensor with NaN values\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, -2.0, nan],\n"
"...                   [3.0, nan, -4.0]])\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1.5811, 3.5355])"
msgstr ""
">>> # NaN 値を含む 2 次元テンソル\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, -2.0, nan],\n"
"...                   [3.0, nan, -4.0]])\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1.5811, 3.5355])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:58
msgid ""
">>> # With keepdim\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[1.5811],\n"
"        [3.5355]])"
msgstr ""
">>> # keepdim を使用\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[1.5811],\n"
"        [3.5355]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:63
msgid ""
">>> # All NaN slice returns NaN\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[3.0, -4.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([3.5355,    nan])"
msgstr ""
">>> # すべて NaN のスライスは NaN を返す\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[3.0, -4.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanrms(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([3.5355,    nan])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:69
msgid ""
"Infinite values are valid values: any slice containing ``inf`` or "
"``-inf`` yields ``inf`` because squaring makes it positive infinity. Only"
" NaN values are skipped."
msgstr "無限大の値は有効な値です。``inf`` または ``-inf`` を含むスライスは、二乗によって正の無限大となるため、結果は ``inf`` になります。スキップされるのは NaN 値のみです。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:74
msgid ":func:`rms`: Root mean square function (NaN propagates)."
msgstr ":func:`rms`: 二乗平均平方根関数（NaN は伝播します）。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:75
msgid ":func:`nanmean`: NaN-aware mean function."
msgstr ":func:`nanmean`: NaN を考慮した平均関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanrms.nanrms:76
msgid ":func:`nanstd`: NaN-aware standard deviation function."
msgstr ":func:`nanstd`: NaN を考慮した標準偏差関数。"

